    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST &amp; JOIN DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/dae8388b160e4d039fd26a6b8279eaf3.avif?t=1717163031\" width=600 height=109 /></span><br><strong>Begin a New Life with Whiskers and Coffee \ud83d\udc3e</strong><br>Step into your new life as the owner of a charming but rundown cafe. Your mission? To clean, renovate, and bring warmth to a place where both humans and cats can find comfort in the cozy ambiance of your making.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/207e1e45d4c74b07f3a4ba0eb8691d69.poster.avif?t=1717163031\" width=538 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/207e1e45d4c74b07f3a4ba0eb8691d69.webm?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/207e1e45d4c74b07f3a4ba0eb8691d69.mp4?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/1474c11038d324ed4ee217f568ee13df.avif?t=1717163031\" width=600 height=114 /></span><br><strong>Expand, Enhance, Enrich \ud83d\udcb0</strong><br>As your cafe thrives, opportunities to expand across Cat City will emerge. Acquire new locations with stunning city views, and offer countless cats a forever home. Climb from modest beginnings to the a Cat Cafe Tycoon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/bf636df1984928f7d74f2be16e30d36d.poster.avif?t=1717163031\" width=538 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/bf636df1984928f7d74f2be16e30d36d.webm?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/bf636df1984928f7d74f2be16e30d36d.mp4?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/555e0f6a56f59e5d02d804e836f36b04.avif?t=1717163031\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br><strong>Reel In the Good Times \ud83c\udfa3\ud83d\udcf8</strong><br>When you're not pouring lattes or fluffing pillows, indulge in the quaint pleasures of Cat City. Fish in the tranquil city lake, share pictures on Catgram, and watch as your cafe becomes viral!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/54f5bfc9645dd17c825284e23851b0a5.poster.avif?t=1717163031\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/54f5bfc9645dd17c825284e23851b0a5.webm?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/54f5bfc9645dd17c825284e23851b0a5.mp4?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/b6ef3c9ba09e82678eb41d34be902c93.avif?t=1717163031\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><strong>Design and Decorate\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\ud83c\udfa8</strong><br>Roll up your sleeves and unleash your creativity as you paint and decorate your cafe to your liking. Choose from hundreds of furniture and d\u00e9cor options to create a space that's uniquely yours \u2013 where every cushion invites a catnap and every shelf is a catwalk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/a900b303edccaa8bac2d7f157e0ad75b.poster.avif?t=1717163031\" width=506 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/a900b303edccaa8bac2d7f157e0ad75b.webm?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925530/extras/a900b303edccaa8bac2d7f157e0ad75b.mp4?t=1717163031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
